    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Trigger:</em> The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} takes Piercing or Slashing damage. Response—<em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=RlejocPKjkp39jKo]], each creature of the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s choice in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage 3d6 average type=acid]] damage, and the target is cursed until it finishes a Short or Long Rest. While cursed, the target can't benefit from the &amp;Reference[Invisible apply=false] condition, its Speed decreases by 10 feet, and all Fiends within 120 feet of the target can sense its location regardless of interposing obstacles.</p>",
